 don’t work for you — even a uterus.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/01/magazine/letter-of-recommendation-hysterectomies.html', 'snippet': 'Recognizing the power of cutting out the things that don’t work for you — even a uterus.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Facebook is so persistent and skillful at unearthing past versions of yourself that you would rather forget. A few weeks ago, it reminded me about a photo from the fall of 2016: I’m in a train station outside Milan, waiting for a ride to a beautiful, small Italian town, and there’s a fake, slightly annoyed smile on my face, even though I should be happy.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '28', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/04/magazine/04mag-lor/04mag-04lor-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/04/magazine/04mag-lor/04mag-04lor-t_CA0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 437}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/04/magazine/04mag-lor/04mag-04lor-t_CA0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 745, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/04/magazine/04mag-lor/04mag-04lor-t_CA0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1491, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/04/magazine/04mag-lor/04mag-04lor-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/04/magazine/04mag-lor/04mag-04lor-t_CA0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}