omoting New York.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/01/nyregion/federal-government-does-not-love-cuomo-highway-signs.html', 'snippet': 'The federal government said it will dock the state $14 million for out-of-compliance highway signs promoting New York.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hundreds of big blue “I ♥ NY” signs that Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo had installed beside the state’s highways have cost more than $8 million. Designed to draw tourists, they instead brought the ire of the federal government, which for two years has demanded their removal, arguing the billboards are in violation of highway rules and are distracting to drivers.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/nyregion/02signs/merlin_115002125_83e2070d-89cd-45f2-9676-aee37eac8840-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/02/nyregion/02signs/merlin_115002125_83e2070d-89cd-45f2-9676-aee37eac8840-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 427}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/nyregion/02signs/merlin_115002125_83e2070d-89cd-45f2-9676-aee37eac8840-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 729, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/nyregion/02signs/merlin_115002125_83e2070d-89cd-45f2-9676-aee37eac8840-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1459, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/nyregion/02signs/02signs-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStanda