'nyt://article/de603e5f-ffca-5292-92b7-662938b3e0d5'}, {'abstract': 'The industry has gone from villain to victor, the result of a lobbying campaign that has culminated in a far friendlier approach by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/02/us/politics/payday-lenders-lobbying-regulations.html', 'snippet': 'The industry has gone from villain to victor, the result of a lobbying campaign that has culminated in a far friendlier approach by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In mid-April, hundreds of members of the payday lending industry will head to Florida for their annual retreat featuring golf and networking at a plush resort just outside Miami. The resort just happens to be the Trump National Doral Golf Club.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/business/02DC-PAYDAY1/merlin_132523223_421645df-12b3-4bdd-bfc6-d5333c068b38-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/02/business/02DC-PAYDAY1/merlin_132523223_421645df-12b3-4bdd-bfc6-d5333c068b38-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/business/02DC-PAYDAY1/merlin_132523223_421645df-12b3-4bdd-bfc6-d5333c068b38-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/02/business/02DC-PAYDAY1/merlin_132523223_421645df-12b3-4bdd-bfc6-d5333c068b38-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': Non