': 818, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9807b407-012f-5bbb-b3f7-e1a5140fba4b'}, {'abstract': 'It is time to speak out against the unfair partisan attacks against the bureau.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/02/opinion/leaving-the-fbi.html', 'snippet': 'It is time to speak out against the unfair partisan attacks against the bureau.', 'lead_paragraph': 'One of the greatest honors of my life was walking across the stage at the F.B.I. Academy and receiving my special agent badge from the director at the time, Robert Mueller. After 21 weeks of intensive training, my class swore an oath and became federal agents entrusted with the solemn duty of protecting Americans and upholding the Constitution.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/merlin_86340754_232375ab-0f86-4409-a1cc-e11cbcc4271d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 393, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/merlin_86340754_232375ab-0f86-4409-a1cc-e11cbcc4271d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 393}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/merlin_86340754_232375ab-0f86-4409-a1cc-e11cbcc4271d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 671, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/merlin_86340754_232375ab-0f86-4409-a1cc-e11cbcc4271d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1343, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/03Campbell-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/03Campbell-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Campbell-web/03Campbell-web-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why I Am Leaving the F.B.I.', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Why I Am Leaving The F.B.I.', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Foreign Intelligence Surveillance Act (FISA)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Justice Department', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Comey, James B', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mueller, Robert S III', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Russian Interference in 2016 US Elections and Ties to Trump Associates', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-03T02:31:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Josh Campbell', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Josh', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Campbell', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/083c88c4-fa40-50b4-a0e3-7680c43c9005', 'word_count': 784, 'uri': 'nyt://article/083c88c4-fa40-50b4-a0e3-7680c43c9005'}, {'abstract': 'As residents embraced the arrival of a new and hopefully better year, a Communist attack, years in the planning, was about to unfold.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/02/opinion/hue-prepared-for-a-holiday-then-the-war-came.html', 'snippet': 'As residents embraced the arrival of a new and hopefully better year, a Communist attack, years in the planning, was about to unfold.', 'lead_paragraph': 'During the early days of January 1968, the 150,000 residents of Hue, like all Vietnamese, began preparations for their biggest event of the year, the three-day lunar new year festival of Tet. Markets were filled with once-a-year treats. Men decorated gardens with flowers and bonsai. Women gathered ingredients for holiday dishes and styled fresh designs for their ao dai tunic dresses. Vendors packed the streets in the hope of making extra money before the holiday arrived.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Vietnam-web/merlin_133229420_6438f28f-db46-4f49-9c08-40f64e007c3c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Vietnam-web/merlin_133229420_6438f28f-db46-4f49-9c08-40f64e007c3c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Vietnam-web/merlin_133229420_6438f28f-db46-4f49-9c08-40f64e007c3c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/03/opinion/03Vietnam-web/merlin_133229420_6438f28f-db46-4f49-9c08-40f64e007c3c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1359, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail'