': 'Broad', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5ec640ab-ffeb-5c7b-9078-3c66940bd221', 'word_count': 1508, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5ec640ab-ffeb-5c7b-9078-3c66940bd221'}, {'abstract': 'The referendum’s passage was widely seen as benefiting the first-term president, Lenín Moreno, at the expense of his three-term rival, Rafael Correa.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/04/world/americas/ecuador-presidential-term-limits.html', 'snippet': 'The referendum’s passage was widely seen as benefiting the first-term president, Lenín Moreno, at the expense of his three-term rival, Rafael Correa.', 'lead_paragraph': 'QUITO, Ecuador — Ecuadoreans on Sunday voted to overturn a 2015 constitutional amendment that eliminated presidential term limits, a result widely seen as strengthening the power of President Lenín Moreno while dealing a potentially fatal political blow to former President Rafael Correa.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/05/world/05ecuador1/merlin_133293020_9c574aa8-c3bf-4a1a-96d5-87741639ebab-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 419, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/05/world/05ecuador1/merlin_133293020_9c574aa8-c3bf-4a1a-96d5-87741639ebab-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 419}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/05/world/05ecuador1/merlin_133293020_9c574aa8-c3bf-4a1a-96d5-87741639ebab-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/05/world/05ecuador1/merlin_133293020_9