e-trifonov-carnegie.html', 'snippet': 'The veteran baritone Matthias Goerne and the young pianist Daniil Trifonov were an odd couple who created an eccentric yet utterly winning recital.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The burly veteran German baritone Matthias Goerne, a commanding vocalist if a sometimes intrusive physical presence onstage, and the brilliant yet retiring young Russian pianist Daniil Trifonov may seem an odd couple as recitalists. And their program at Carnegie Hall on Tuesday evening was decidedly eccentric, yet utterly winning. Mr. Trifonov conceived the event as part of his Carnegie Perspectives series this season, and the respect and affinity he showed toward Mr. Goerne were clearly mutual.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/merlin_133416339_dbf7a5e0-e0cc-42d6-a135-d745527d5d8f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/merlin_133416339_dbf7a5e0-e0cc-42d6-a135-d745527d5d8f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/merlin_133416339_dbf7a5e0-e0cc-42d6-a135-d745527d5d8f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/merlin_133416339_dbf7a5e0-e0cc-42d6-a135-d745527d5d8f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/08GOERNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/08GOERNE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/arts/10GOERNE-sub/08GOERNE-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Review: Unlikely Pairing Turns to Intense Affinity at Carnegie', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'An Odd Couple Is a Striking Match', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Classical Music', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Carnegie Hall', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Goerne, Matthias', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trifonov, Daniil', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-07T19:08:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Culture', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Music', 'byline': {'original': 'By James R. Oestreich', 'person': [{'firstname': 'James', 'middlename': 'R.', 'lastname': 'Oestreich', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Review', '_id': 'nyt://article/40b766d6-94ee-5bbb-b07d-782a47e24693', 'word_count': 512, 'uri': 'nyt://article/40b766d6-94ee-5bbb-b07d-782a47e24693'}, {'abstract': 'The return of the ailing 81-year-old diplomat, an American, to prison is the act of a cruel and unjust Iranian government.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/07/opinion/baquer-namazi-iran-prison.html', 'snippet': 'The return of the ailing 81-year-old diplomat, an American, to prison is the act of a cruel and unjust Iranian government.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When Baquer Namazi, the oldest American known to be held in Iran, was released on medical leave Jan. 28 from Tehran’s infamous Evin Prison, it was an unexpected and unusual act of mercy. There was even some hope that Mr. Namazi, an 81-year-old former diplomat for Unicef, might be granted parole. On Tuesday, those hopes were dashed as the authorities ordered the ailing Mr. Namazi to return to jail, a decision so lacking in compassion that the Trump administration must intervene.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/08/opinion/08thu3-web/merlin_113302460_408ac1b6-1761-4a57-b462-abbfb9cffcfb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/08/opinion/08thu3-web/merlin_113302460_408ac1b6-1761-4a57-b462-abbfb9cffcfb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/08/opinion/08thu3-web/merlin_113302460_408ac1b6-1761-4a57-b462-abbfb9cffcfb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/08/opinion/08thu3-web/merlin_113302460_408ac1b6-1761-4a57-b462-abbfb9cffcfb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1365, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/08/opinion/08thu3-web/08thu3-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/08/opinion/08thu3-web/08thu3-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/08