ut a huge infrastructure investment, but can we even make the trains run on time? Our beleaguered columnist is skeptical.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/08/business/airport-infrastructure-trump.html', 'snippet': 'President Trump has talked about a huge infrastructure investment, but can we even make the trains run on time? Our beleaguered columnist is skeptical.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Sunday before last, as I emerged tired and dispirited from Penn Station after a two-plus hour trip from the Newark airport, I found myself pondering President Trump’s campaign pledge “to spur $1 trillion in infrastructure investment,” a theme he raised  in this year’s State of the Union address and is expected to address again next week.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/09/business/09STEWART1/merlin_116880011_0ef54cda-fbc3-4583-b682-a3ff54c12cdc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/09/business/09STEWART1/merlin_116880011_0ef54cda-fbc3-4583-b682-a3ff54c12cdc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/09/business/09STEWART1/merlin_116880011_0ef54cda-fbc3-4583-b682-a3ff54c12cdc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/09/business/09STEWART1/merlin_116880011_0ef54cda-fbc3-4583-b682-a3ff54c12cdc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/09/business/09ST