ot of butter, may very well be in your future.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/09/dining/what-to-cook-this-weekend-newsletter.html', 'snippet': 'Seafood chowder, with a base of root-cellar vegetables, clams and a lot of butter, may very well be in your future.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Good morning. I had this crazily delicious packet of fish a while back at the restaurant Houseman here in Manhattan — baked bluefish, wrapped in Swiss chard. I know. I didn’t think it would be crazily delicious, either. But it was and I was amazed and eventually I interrogated the restaurant’s chef, Ned Baldwin, about how he’d made it.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/magazine/11mag-eat1-copy/11mag-eat1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/11/magazine/11mag-eat1-copy/11mag-eat1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/magazine/11mag-eat1-copy/11mag-eat1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/magazine/11mag-eat1-copy/11mag-eat1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/magazine/11mag-eat1-copy/11mag-eat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/11/magazine/11mag-eat1-copy/11mag-eat1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge