questions from the judge as a way of protesting European justice, defense lawyers say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/09/world/europe/salah-abdeslam-trial-brussels-paris-attacks.html', 'snippet': 'At trial in Belgium, Salah Abdeslam refuses to answer questions from the judge as a way of protesting European justice, defense lawyers say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BRUSSELS — The judges were there, the lawyers and the press — so many journalists that there was a spillover room. The only person largely missing from the trial was the high-profile defendant, the only surviving member of the group accused of carrying out terrorist attacks in Paris in 2015 and Brussels in 2016.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/world/europe/11trial1/merlin_133455746_59ffffab-decc-42db-92da-aaaef4cda5b1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 415, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/11/world/europe/11trial1/merlin_133455746_59ffffab-decc-42db-92da-aaaef4cda5b1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 415}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/world/europe/11trial1/merlin_133455746_59ffffab-decc-42db-92da-aaaef4cda5b1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 708, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/world/europe/11trial1/merlin_133455746_59ffffab-decc-42db-92da-aaaef4cda5b1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1417, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/11/world/europe/11trial1/10trial1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 7