t has divided Saskatchewan and previews The Times’s Winter Olympics coverage.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For families who have lost a member to violence, the court case that follows often churns up a new bout of grief. That certainly is the case for the family of Colten Boushie, a 22-year-man from the Red Pheasant Cree Nation in Saskatchewan who was shot and killed by Gerald Stanley, a farmer on whose property Mr. Boushie and four other young Indigenous people appeared in August 2016.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/world/10Canadaletter1/merlin_133442802_5951a8e0-f189-4fe0-a606-0adbf46f0f42-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/10/world/10Canadaletter1/merlin_133442802_5951a8e0-f189-4fe0-a606-0adbf46f0f42-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/world/10Canadaletter1/merlin_133442802_5951a8e0-f189-4fe0-a606-0adbf46f0f42-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/world/10Canadaletter1/merlin_133442802_5951a8e0-f189-4fe0-a606-0adbf46f0f42-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/world/10Canadaletter1/10Canadaletter1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/10/world/10Canadaletter1/10Canadaletter1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype