/us/politics/john-kelly-porter-marines.html', 'snippet': 'As a Marine general, John F. Kelly was used to defending subordinates. Standing up for a White House aide accused of abuse has raised the specter of his own resignation.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2013, John F. Kelly, a general at the time, defended a junior Marine officer who was accused of poor leadership after going on patrol in Afghanistan with team members who urinated on the bodies of three dead Taliban militants. Two years later, in 2015, he stood up for a Marine colonel facing a litany of charges, including sexual harassment.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/us/politics/10dc-marine/merlin_133071923_7387ae85-64c5-434a-8f97-5b6d38ac20a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/10/us/politics/10dc-marine/merlin_133071923_7387ae85-64c5-434a-8f97-5b6d38ac20a4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/us/politics/10dc-marine/merlin_133071923_7387ae85-64c5-434a-8f97-5b6d38ac20a4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/us/politics/10dc-marine/merlin_133071923_7387ae85-64c5-434a-8f97-5b6d38ac20a4-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/us/politics/10dc-marine/10dc-marine-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/10/us/polit