, 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/be16abc2-6f02-59b5-8735-ccf539cbdfe4', 'word_count': 145, 'uri': 'nyt://article/be16abc2-6f02-59b5-8735-ccf539cbdfe4'}, {'abstract': 'The chocolate Charlotte cake at La Mercerie makes a sweet last-minute Valentine’s Day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/12/dining/la-mercerie-cake.html', 'snippet': 'The chocolate Charlotte cake at La Mercerie makes a sweet last-minute Valentine’s Day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Need a last-minute Valentine’s treat? There’s an intensely chocolate flourless cake modestly displayed among the pastries on the counter at La Mercerie, the shop and restaurant in the Roman and Williams Guild in SoHo. It’s a paragon of Auguste Escoffier’s mantra “faites simple” (keep it simple), and is sold whole or by the slice. And with the restaurant set to open any day now, look for the cake on the menu: Gluten-free Chocolate Cake, $45 whole, $5 per slice, La Mercerie, 53 Howard Street (Mercer Street), 212-852-9097, lamerceriecafe.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/merlin_133144794_58b18532-d88c-4bb2-927d-7460d58f9f30-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/merlin_133144794_58b18532-d88c-4bb2-927d-7460d58f9f30-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/merlin_133144794_58b18532-d88c-4bb2-927d-7460d58f9f30-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/merlin_133144794_58b18532-d88c-4bb2-927d-7460d58f9f30-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/14burnercake-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/14burnercake-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/dining/14burnercake/14burnercake-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Flourless Chocolate Cake Keeps It Simple', 'kicker': 'Front Burner', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'To Slice: A Chocolate Cake:  No Flour, No Fuss', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Restaurants', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'ROMAN & WILLIAMS', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cakes', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chocolate', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'La Mercerie (Manhattan, NY, Restaurant)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-12T17:54:40+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Florence Fabricant', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Florence', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Fabricant', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/f85a473f-1ee4-5dff-a81a-d7ec7e51baa1', 'word_count': 88, 'uri': 'nyt://article/f85a473f-1ee4-5dff-a81a-d7ec7e51baa1'}, {'abstract': 'Joshua Werber created designs inspired by T’s story on women artists.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/12/t-magazine/design/joshua-werber-flower-headpieces.html', 'snippet': 'Joshua Werber created designs inspired by T’s story on women artists.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For our story on women artists in museums, five designers created working uniforms for female artists from history, exclusively for T. To accompany the piece, the Brooklyn-based floral artist Joshua Werber created a headpiece to complement each design — and modeled them himself. “In designing the headpieces to accompany the uniforms for this story, the sketches and source materials were the primary inspiration,” he said. “Specific references to the artists’ work and the intentions set by the designers influenced the shapes, forms and styles.” Click through our slide show to see Werber’s floral designs.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Floral Headpieces, Inspired by Female Artists', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Flowers and Plants', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-12T17:57:05+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'subsection_name': 'Design & Interiors', 'byline': {'original': 'By T Magazine', 'person': [{'firstname': '', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1bdaacb3-7e11-5f2f-b59f-33a7deb292ee', 'word_count': 94, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1bdaacb3-7e11-5f2f-b59f-33a7deb292ee'}, {'abstract': 'Inspired by our piece on designers and the female artists they admire, the floral artist creates designs exclusively for T.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/slideshow/2018/02/12/t-magazine/joshua-werbers-floral-headpieces-for-artists.html', 'snippet': 'Inspired by our piece on designers and the female artists they admire, the floral artist creates designs exclusively for T.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Inspired by our piece on designers and the female artists they admire, the floral artist creates designs exclusively for T.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX/12tmag-werber-slide-DHKX-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0,