e White House before finally burning it.', 'print_section': 'M2', 'print_page': '167', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 691, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 691}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 890, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1893, 'width': 1644, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/01/29/t-magazine/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3/29tmag-portraits-slide-O1D3-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The New Face of Portrait Painting', 'kicker': 'Arts and Letters', 'content_kicker