terial': 'briefing', '_id': 'nyt://article/45ec9f02-18bb-58e1-bc45-50a7335fbf59', 'word_count': 1075, 'uri': 'nyt://article/45ec9f02-18bb-58e1-bc45-50a7335fbf59'}, {'abstract': 'The speedskater, admired by many as the first African-American to win a solo gold at a Winter Games, has kept quiet since denouncing the flag-bearer selection process.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/13/sports/olympics/shani-davis-speedskating.html', 'snippet': 'The speedskater, admired by many as the first African-American to win a solo gold at a Winter Games, has kept quiet since denouncing the flag-bearer selection process.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GANGNEUNG, South Korea — The American speedskater Shani Davis swerved around a corner, on foot, in a subterranean postrace interview room at the Gangneung Oval on Tuesday night and slowed to a halt in front of a small pack of mostly American journalists. Davis, a celebrated Olympian, was about to take his first questions from the news media since arriving at the Winter Games last week.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/merlin_133769712_817c7010-15ee-4725-ab9d-4732b46a1af7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/merlin_133769712_817c7010-15ee-4725-ab9d-4732b46a1af7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/merlin_133769712_817c7010-15ee-4725-ab9d-4732b46a1af7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/merlin_133769712_817c7010-15ee-4725-ab9d-4732b46a1af7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/14shani-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/14shani-web-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/sports/14shani-web/14shani-web-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Shani Davis Goes His Own Way, and Controversy Follows', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Trailblazer Zigs as Others Zag', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Davis, Shani', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Short-Track Speedskating', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2018)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'United States Olympic Committee', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-13T11:19:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Andrew Keh', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Andrew', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Keh', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/59464604-3eb1-5ec3-85bd-b4dbedade350', 'word_count': 1158, 'uri': 'nyt://article/59464604-3eb1-5ec3-85bd-b4dbedade350'}, {'abstract': 'In two early tweets, Mr. Trump said a March deadline to protect young immigrants would be the “last chance,” and suggested that Democrats should come to a deal on his infrastructure proposal.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/13/us/politics/trump-twitter-daca-infrastructure.html', 'snippet': 'In two early tweets, Mr. Trump said a March deadline to protect young immigrants would be the “last chance,” and suggested that Democrats should come to a deal on his infrastructure proposal.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — In a pair of tweets before 6 a.m. on Tuesday, President Trump increased pressure on Democrats, reminding them of a countdown to strike a deal with Republicans so that young undocumented immigrants have a path to legally stay in the United States. He also appeared to suggest that if his recently unveiled infrastructure plan were unsuccessful, it would be the Democrats’ fault.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/us/politics/14dc-trump/merlin_133718340_a25a275b-055f-4a9f-872e-6e10bae05dd3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/14/us/politics/14dc-trump/merlin_133718340_a25a275b-055f-4a9f-872e-6e10bae05dd3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/us/politics/14dc-trump/merlin_133718340_a25a275b-055f-4a9f-872e-6e10bae05dd3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/14/us/politics/14dc-trump/merlin_133718340_a25a275b-055f-4a9f-872e-6e10bae05dd3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': No