: 1257, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b4dd3e52-1e8a-5c2a-83cf-6555ef3bc586'}, {'abstract': 'A delicious new crop of cocoa-based products boast surprising wellness benefits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/13/t-magazine/healthier-chocolate.html', 'snippet': 'A delicious new crop of cocoa-based products boast surprising wellness benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It was after the birth of her second child that the personal chef Karolina Palmer got into eating clean. “I was growing more interested in adaptogenic herbs and superfoods to support myself in that crazy postpartum period,” she says. Then, Palmer got invited to a potluck dinner. What could she possibly make from a pantry filled with things like ashwagandha and He Shou Wu? Inspiration struck when she spotted a bag of raw cocoa, and decided to whip up chocolate truffles infused with herbal mushrooms, rice bran solubles, maca, goji berries and pumpkin seeds. The batch, she says, was “a hit.”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/12/t-magazine/fashion/12tmag-cocoa-01/12tmag-cocoa-01-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The New, Healthier Chocolate', 'kicker': 'On Wellness', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Health; Better Chocolate', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Chocolate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cocoa', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Alternative and Complementary Medicine', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-13T16:00:23+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'TStyle', 'section_name': 'T Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Kari Molvar', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Kari', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Molvar', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4c5146e1-2f93-5400-bda6-88b686c383a1', 'word_count': 621, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4c5146e1-2f93-5400-bda6-88b686c383a1'}, {'abstract': 'Merele Williams-Adkins honors her husband’s memory by preserving the art he made and the pieces he collected in their Brooklyn home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/13/arts/design/she-married-an-artist-and-now-finds-comfort-in-his-work.html', 'snippet': 'Merele Williams-Adkins honors her husband’s memory by preserving the art he made and the pieces he collected in their Brooklyn home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Merele Williams, a lawyer by training, was sick of dating doctors and lawyers. She set her sights on meeting an artist, and at a party in 1991, she did. Chatting with the sculptor and musician Terry Adkins, Ms. Williams gave him a thorough grilling on his bona fides. Mr. Adkins, in turn, scoffed at her preferences in art. That night he proposed, and nine months later they were married.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 465, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 465}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 794, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1587, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16showwall1/16showwall1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'She Married an Artist, and Now Finds Comfort in His Work', 'kicker': 'Show Us Your Wall', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'A Husband’s Legacy Provides Comfort', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Art', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Adkins, Terry (1953-2014)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Ligon, Glenn', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cyrus, Jamal (1973- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Collectors and Collections', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-13T16:00:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Weekend', 'section_name': 'Arts', 'subsection_name': 'Art & Design', 'byline': {'original': 'By Hilarie M. Sheets', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Hilarie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': '', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/bcade2cf-103a-5040-acf0-ef47cc292623', 'word_count': 819, 'uri': 'nyt://article/bcade2cf-103a-5040-acf0-ef47cc292623'}, {'abstract': 'Bob Hugin announced his candidacy for the Republican nomination for the seat currently held by Democratic Senator Robert Menendez.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/13/nyregion/bob-hugin-robert-menendez-senate-new-jerey.html', 'snippet': 'Bob Hugin announced his candidacy for the Republican nomination for the seat currently held by Democratic Senator Robert Menendez.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SPRINGFIELD, N.J. — Bob Hugin, a former pharmaceutical executive, announced he is running for the Republican nomination for Senate here on Tuesday, giving Democratic Senator Robert Menendez a deep-pocketed potential challenger as he seeks re-election after federal corruption charges against him were dropped.', 'print_section': 'A', 'p