est whether a rule-bound court is prepared to stand up to a norm-breaking president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/15/opinion/supreme-court-trump-enabler.html', 'snippet': 'The administration’s effort to rush a decision on DACA will test whether a rule-bound court is prepared to stand up to a norm-breaking president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With all the noise coming out of Washington, it’s been easy to forget about the Supreme Court. The court has been very quiet: during a recess of nearly four weeks, only the peripatetic Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg has made news, of a sort.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15Greenhouse-web/merlin_130965137_7e31a3b1-e157-4c1e-b01e-b81a8e6c5717-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15Greenhouse-web/merlin_130965137_7e31a3b1-e157-4c1e-b01e-b81a8e6c5717-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15Greenhouse-web/merlin_130965137_7e31a3b1-e157-4c1e-b01e-b81a8e6c5717-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15Greenhouse-web/merlin_130965137_7e31a3b1-e157-4c1e-b01e-b81a8e6c5717-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15Greenhouse-web/15Greenhouse-web-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/1