ng to save lives in heavy combat day after day.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/15/opinion/combat-medic-vietnam.html', 'snippet': 'The war looked easy at first. Then came the buildup to the Tet offensive, and we found ourselves trying to save lives in heavy combat day after day.', 'lead_paragraph': 'BAYAMÓN, P.R. — The experience never leaves a combat medic: the sight, the smell, the touch of flowing blood. The mutilated limbs. The moment of watching, helpless, as life turns to death. Fifty years later, the memories still trickle into my soul, as if through an IV tube as I wait, wounded, for evac from a Vietnam clearing.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15vietnamWeb/15vietnamWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15vietnamWeb/15vietnamWeb-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15vietnamWeb/15vietnamWeb-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15vietnamWeb/15vietnamWeb-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15vietnamWeb/15vietnamWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/15/opinion/15vietnamWeb/15vietnamWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 