oddly persuasive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The hip-hop entrepreneur Damon Dash has been producing and directing motion pictures since the late 1990s. You’d never know it from looking at “Honor Up,” a new movie he directed from a script he wrote with Kevin Bennett.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/merlin_133544567_f6910a98-bbc1-423b-913b-a82e030cd16e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 254, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/merlin_133544567_f6910a98-bbc1-423b-913b-a82e030cd16e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 254}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/merlin_133544567_f6910a98-bbc1-423b-913b-a82e030cd16e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 434, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/merlin_133544567_f6910a98-bbc1-423b-913b-a82e030cd16e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 867, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/16honorup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/16honorup-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/movies/16honorup/16honorup-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legac