'}, {'abstract': 'It’s long been believed that inflation and higher interest rates are bad for stock prices. Now, it’s unclear how the markets will react.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/15/business/inflation-stocks-interest-rates.html', 'snippet': 'It’s long been believed that inflation and higher interest rates are bad for stock prices. Now, it’s unclear how the markets will react.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two weeks ago, fears of higher-than-expected inflation and interest rates sent stocks into a historic and nerve-rattling plunge. This week, those fears were borne out: Consumer prices rose more than expected in January, and interest rates jumped.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/business/JP10TURBULENCE/JP10TURBULENCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/10/business/JP10TURBULENCE/JP10TURBULENCE-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/business/JP10TURBULENCE/JP10TURBULENCE-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/business/JP10TURBULENCE/JP10TURBULENCE-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/10/business/JP10TURBULENCE/JP10TURBULENCE-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/10/business/JP10TURBULENCE/JP10TURBULENCE-thumbSt