 Biennial. Critical of the post-revolutionary politics of Cuba, it was shut down by censors within hours. Much has changed in the interim. Fidel Castro, the revolutionary turned authoritarian leader whose image is at the center of her installation, which includes black-and-white video images, died in 2016. And art institutions have fully embraced the kind of performance and participatory art Ms. Bruguera makes, which uses live human bodies as a medium.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16TANIA-01/merlin_133796465_0f205a91-e611-45a4-8eab-eb010e5f1094-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16TANIA-01/merlin_133796465_0f205a91-e611-45a4-8eab-eb010e5f1094-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16TANIA-01/merlin_133796465_0f205a91-e611-45a4-8eab-eb010e5f1094-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16TANIA-01/merlin_133796465_0f205a91-e611-45a4-8eab-eb010e5f1094-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1897, 'width': 1897, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16TANIA-01/merlin_133796465_0f205a91-e611-45a4-8eab-eb010e5f1094-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/16/arts/16TANIA-01/merlin_133796465_0f205a91-e611-45a4-8eab-eb010e5f1094-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailw