and actors collaborate at a monthly show at Upright Citizens Brigade called “Gravid Water.” And that’s just fine with a theater critic.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/16/theater/gravid-water-upright-citizens-brigade.html', 'snippet': 'Words on the page are only a start when improvisers and actors collaborate at a monthly show at Upright Citizens Brigade called “Gravid Water.” And that’s just fine with a theater critic.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Here’s the thing about plays. They follow a script. They have to. Tradition and licensing agreements insist. So Oedipus never turns down Jocasta. Laura’s glass unicorn always breaks. Hamlet is going to be A.B.D. forever.', 'print_section': 'AR', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/arts/18GRAVID-1/00GRAVID-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/18/arts/18GRAVID-1/00GRAVID-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/arts/18GRAVID-1/00GRAVID-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/arts/18GRAVID-1/00GRAVID-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/arts/18GRAVID-1/25GRAVID-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/18/arts/18GRAVID-1/25GRAVID-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, 