e': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/800e4411-fb7e-553e-b846-564b10f9a75f', 'word_count': 2421, 'uri': 'nyt://article/800e4411-fb7e-553e-b846-564b10f9a75f'}, {'abstract': 'After legislative efforts collapsed Thursday in the Senate, lawmakers in the House and Senate struggled for a path forward to protect the “Dreamers.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/16/us/politics/congress-immigration-dreamers.html', 'snippet': 'After legislative efforts collapsed Thursday in the Senate, lawmakers in the House and Senate struggled for a path forward to protect the “Dreamers.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Congressional leaders struggled on Friday to find a path forward on legislation to protect hundreds of thousands of so-called Dreamers after the Senate’s efforts collapsed into a partisan morass. Immigrant rights advocates, losing faith in the legislative process, nervously turned their attention to the courts.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/17/us/politics/17dc-immig/merlin_132678248_7566e79b-7473-4507-a24a-74b8834c6cc4-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/17/us/politics/17dc-immig/merlin_132678248_7566e79b-7473-4507-a24a-74b8834c6cc4-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/17/us/politics/17dc-immig/merlin_132678248_7566e79b-7473-4507-a24a-74b8834c6cc4-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/17/us/politics/17dc-immig/merlin_13267