cle/26fd6eaf-3576-5c50-96e7-d42c68fc8f81'}, {'abstract': 'The 3-point shot has increasingly become the signature play of the N.B.A. So why shouldn’t it resonate at the league’s All-Star weekend?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/16/sports/basketball/nba-all-star-dunk-3-pointers.html', 'snippet': 'The 3-point shot has increasingly become the signature play of the N.B.A. So why shouldn’t it resonate at the league’s All-Star weekend?', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — It has been 30 years since Michael Jordan launched himself from the free-throw line and slammed the ball through the hoop to edge out Dominique Wilkins in an epic N.B.A. slam dunk contest. Not surprisingly, that moment has now inspired a 30th anniversary special edition sneaker. Not surprising, either, is that the league has jumped in, too, releasing a highlight reel of every dunk that drew a perfect score in the contest’s 34-year history, as Jordan’s did that night.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/17/sports/17threepoint-1/merlin_104512456_829decf0-ab95-4176-8bde-70b9ab081d84-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 862, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/17/sports/17threepoint-1/merlin_104512456_829decf0-ab95-4176-8bde-70b9ab081d84-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 862}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/17/sports/17threepoint-1/merlin_104512456_829decf0-ab95-4176-8bde-70b9ab081d84-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 713, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/17/sports/17threepoint-1/merlin_104512456_829decf0-ab95-4176-8bde-70b9ab081d84-superJumbo.jpg', 'heig