unt': 846, 'uri': 'nyt://article/91e5f2be-7c58-5b67-970e-2e61f819d504'}, {'abstract': 'The photos I took of the fighting have never been published, until now.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/17/opinion/sunday/the-battle-for-hue-1968.html', 'snippet': 'The photos I took of the fighting have never been published, until now.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Fifty years ago, I spent five days with a company of Marines in Hue, the imperial capital of Vietnam, as they fought to recapture the city from the North Vietnamese Army. I was a reporter for the Time-Life News Service, but I had a camera with me and took photos of the fighting. I was wounded on Feb. 19 and evacuated; in the process I lost my camera, and by the time I got it back, the fighting was over, and it was too late for the pictures to run. This is the first time they’ve been published.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/opinion/sunday/18Greenway1/18Vowell1-1518801659506-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 426, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/18/opinion/sunday/18Greenway1/18Vowell1-1518801659506-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 426}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/opinion/sunday/18Greenway1/18Vowell1-1518801659506-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 727, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/18/opinion/sunday/18Greenway1/18Vowell1-1518801659506-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1453, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2