_material': 'Obituary (Obit)', '_id': 'nyt://article/57832fff-2e9d-5b96-bb23-8229b6ed2aad', 'word_count': 809, 'uri': 'nyt://article/57832fff-2e9d-5b96-bb23-8229b6ed2aad'}, {'abstract': 'Around the country, teachers are reflecting on whether they are prepared to take a bullet for their students. “I think about it all the time,” one said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/19/us/teachers-school-shootings.html', 'snippet': 'Around the country, teachers are reflecting on whether they are prepared to take a bullet for their students. “I think about it all the time,” one said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'TAMARAC, Fla. — The shooting was all over, but the emotional reckoning had just begun, and so on Saturday the teachers of Broward County packed their union hall to discuss what it meant to have become the nation’s human shields.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/us/20teachers-02/20teachers-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/20/us/20teachers-02/20teachers-02-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/us/20teachers-02/20teachers-02-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/us/20teachers-02/20teachers-02-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/us/20teachers-02/20teachers-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': '