t-magazine/adwoa-aboah-london-fashion-week.html', 'snippet': 'In two jam-packed days, the model and activist speaks about positive fashion, walks in Christopher Bailey’s final show for Burberry — and supports emerging designers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Straight off a red-eye flight from New York on Friday morning, the model Adwoa Aboah steps into the thick of London Fashion Week. She stops briefly at her parents’ house — she lives in Brooklyn, but stays with her family in Notting Hill when she’s in town — to change into a Molly Goddard tulle dress before heading to 180 Strand, the official venue of LFW, to deliver a rousing speech on the treatment of models, diversity and the importance of supporting emerging talent as the British Fashion Council’s newly appointed ambassador for positive fashion.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/19/t-magazine/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU/19tmag-adwoa-slide-DRAU-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/19/t-magazine/1