ools to teach the world about population control.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/19/obituaries/david-poindexter-dead.html', 'snippet': 'A Methodist minister, he saw TV and radio programming — soap operas, in particular — as effective tools to teach the world about population control.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Rev. David Poindexter, a Methodist minister who worked with television and radio producers worldwide to inject story lines into their programs about overpopulation, died on Feb. 8 in Portland, Ore. He was 89.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/obituaries/poindexter-obit-1/poindexter-obit-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 366, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/obituaries/poindexter-obit-1/poindexter-obit-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 433, 'width': 366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/obituaries/poindexter-obit-1/poindexter-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/21/obituaries/poindexter-obit-1/poindexter-obit-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/obituaries/poindexter-obit-1/poindexter-obit-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'David Poindexter, 89, Who Used Media to Preach Family Planning, Dies', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'David 