bstract': 'Republicans will complain again about overweening government, accelerating social change and American decline.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/20/opinion/trump-conservatism-republicans.html', 'snippet': 'Republicans will complain again about overweening government, accelerating social change and American decline.', 'lead_paragraph': 'With President Trump’s support, Republican majorities in both chambers of Congress recently enacted an enormous increase in government spending, reversing the only major policy victory of Tea Party insurgents in 2011. Given this blasphemy, where is the conservative revolt?', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/opinion/20grossmanWeb/merlin_118604750_a0a3b888-44aa-4bff-a967-e8909090d3cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/20/opinion/20grossmanWeb/merlin_118604750_a0a3b888-44aa-4bff-a967-e8909090d3cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/opinion/20grossmanWeb/merlin_118604750_a0a3b888-44aa-4bff-a967-e8909090d3cc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/opinion/20grossmanWeb/merlin_118604750_a0a3b888-44aa-4bff-a967-e8909090d3cc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/opinion/20grossmanWeb/20grossmanWeb-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna