itors can vote for favorites, and, on March 15, there will be a final competition among the boroughs for a popular winner, as well as a winner determined by professional judges. Admission is free. Food will be sold, and beer is $8 for a full pour and $12 for a flight of five (one from each borough): Winter Biergarten, Thursdays through March 15, 4 to 9 p.m., Brookfield Place, Vesey and West Streets, Battery Park City, brookfieldplaceny.com.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/dining/21Burnerbeer/merlin_133680993_c6ee293c-fda2-4ca9-a5e8-cf2912e23aaf-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/21/dining/21Burnerbeer/merlin_133680993_c6ee293c-fda2-4ca9-a5e8-cf2912e23aaf-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/dining/21Burnerbeer/merlin_133680993_c6ee293c-fda2-4ca9-a5e8-cf2912e23aaf-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/dining/21Burnerbeer/merlin_133680993_c6ee293c-fda2-4ca9-a5e8-cf2912e23aaf-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/dining/21Burnerbeer/merlin_133680993_c6ee293c-fda2-4ca9-a5e8-cf2912e23aaf-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/21/dining/21Burnerbeer/merlin_133680993_c6ee293c-fda2-4ca9-a5e8-cf2912e23aaf-thumbStandard.jpg', '