 be seen or represented.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'People often ask the artist and designer Pierre Davis how to wear the intricate, largely handmade clothing she creates for her Los Angeles-based line, No Sesso. “There’s this joke I have that maybe I’ll start putting directions in the garments on how to put them on,” she says. In fact, there’s no right answer. “A lot of the pieces can be worn different ways. It’s all good. Who’s to say there’s one way to wear something?”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/t-magazine/fashion/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/20/t-magazine/fashion/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/t-magazine/fashion/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/t-magazine/fashion/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/t-magazine/fashion/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/20/t-magazine/fashion/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH/20tmag-nosesso-slide-MXOH-thumbStanda