tasies. The only solution is to keep guns out of their hands.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/20/opinion/mental-health-stopping-mass-shooters.html', 'snippet': 'There is no reliable cure for angry young men who harbor violent fantasies. The only solution is to keep guns out of their hands.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SACRAMENTO — A few years ago, the police brought a 21-year-old man into the crisis unit where I work as an emergency psychiatrist. His parents had called the police after seeing postings on his Facebook page that praised the Columbine shooters, referred to imminent death and destruction at his community college and promised his own “Day of Retribution.” His brother reported to the police that he had recently purchased a gun.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '23', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1599, 'width': 1599, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21Barnhorst/21Barnhorst-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Mental Health System Can’t Stop Mass Shooters', 'kicker': 'Op-Ed Contributor', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'I Can’t Stop Mass Shooters', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Mental Health and Disorders', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Gun Control', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Psychiatry and Psychiatrists', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Parkland, Fla, Shooting (2018)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cruz, Nikolas', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-21T00:01:24+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Amy Barnhorst', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Amy', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Barnhorst', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/cec56a3b-28fa-51a8-ba6a-f1afced996eb', 'word_count': 920, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cec56a3b-28fa-51a8-ba6a-f1afced996eb'}, {'abstract': 'In Kent, N.Y., firefighters staged a raffle for a semiautomatic gun. But the Florida shooting has led to a reconsideration of the fund-raiser prize.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/20/nyregion/parkland-shooting-raffle-rifle.html', 'snippet': 'In Kent, N.Y., firefighters staged a raffle for a semiautomatic gun. But the Florida shooting has led to a reconsideration of the fund-raiser prize.', 'lead_paragraph': 'KENT, N.Y. — It was a small-town raffle i