osing-rikers.html', 'snippet': 'City and state officials each have roles to play in shuttering New York’s notorious jail complex, once and for all.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A state commission that oversees New York’s correctional system expressed an increasingly common sentiment last week when it said in a report that New York City’s notorious Rikers Island jail complex needed to be shut down faster than the 10-year timeline envisioned by the city. The commission also threatened to shut the complex itself if Mayor Bill de Blasio fails to move expeditiously.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1198, 'width': 1198, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/opinion/21wed2/21wed2-thumbLarge.jpg