uri': 'nyt://article/811a7988-8970-548e-8d80-f92caff942da'}, {'abstract': 'Their hopes for a détente with Mr. Trump, who effectively staged a hostile takeover of a party he joined only in 2012, reflect the realization that rank-and-file Republicans have come to embrace the president.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/21/us/politics/trump-republican-critics-need-support.html', 'snippet': 'Their hopes for a détente with Mr. Trump, who effectively staged a hostile takeover of a party he joined only in 2012, reflect the realization that rank-and-file Republicans have come to embrace the president.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — Mitt Romney did not vote for Donald J. Trump in 2016. Representative Martha McSally of Arizona may not have, either, but she will not say. And Senator Dean Heller of Nevada now insists that he did cast his ballot for Mr. Trump, but for many months, he would not reveal his vote.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/21/us/21Romney_dc/21Romney_dc-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Trump’s Republican Critics Find a Sudden Need for His Support', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Once His Critics, G.O.P. Candidates Warm to Trump', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Elections, Senate', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Romney, Mitt', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Corker, Robert Phillips Jr', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Heller, Dean', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'McSally, Martha', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-21T10:00:22+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Jonathan Martin', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Jonathan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Martin', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/03e5ca35-8d66-53c2-ad0a-5621a19c216d', 'word_count': 1233, 'uri': 'nyt://article/03e5ca35-8d66-53c2-ad0a-5621a19c216d'}, {'abstract': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on reaping the benefits of nepotism and confronting an abusive man on the subway.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/21/magazine/can-i-use-my-dads-connections-to-get-an-internship.html', 'snippet': 'The magazine’s Ethicist columnist on reaping the benefits of nepotism and confronting an abusive man on the subway.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a college student, and like many college students, I am looking to do an internship. My dad’s previous job was at a company that offers internships in my area of interest. He suggested that I consider interning there and use his connection to my advantage.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/magazine/25mag-ethicist/25mag-ethicist-articleLarge.png', 'height': 905, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/magazine/25mag-ethicist/25mag-ethicist-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 905}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/magazine/25mag-ethicist/25mag-ethicist-jumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 680, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/magazine/25mag-ethicist/25mag-ethicist-superJumbo.png', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1359, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/magazine/25mag-ethicist/25mag-ethicist-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/25/magazine/25mag-ethicist/25mag-ethicist-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt