le': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3521f1a3-cf73-570d-9922-adf3d221aefb', 'word_count': 905, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3521f1a3-cf73-570d-9922-adf3d221aefb'}, {'abstract': 'The affordability and accessibility of this small Westchester village have attracted a diverse population — and some have been there for generations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/21/realestate/living-in-elmsford-ny.html', 'snippet': 'The affordability and accessibility of this small Westchester village have attracted a diverse population — and some have been there for generations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Anthony Fucci never intended to move to Elmsford, where most of his family is from and many relatives remain. Nonetheless, in August, after living in various places throughout Westchester County, he bought a home there: a three-bedroom ranch of 1,100 square feet, built in the 1950s on .16 acres. He paid $225,000.', 'print_section': 'RE', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/realestate/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/realestate/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/realestate/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/realestate/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3/25LIVING-ELMSFORD-slide-DZR3-superJumb