News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1fef777e-ea44-53c1-9b59-659940e227f9', 'word_count': 2828, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1fef777e-ea44-53c1-9b59-659940e227f9'}, {'abstract': 'She usually takes 70 pairs to competitions, ready for every kind of race, weather and snow, but she scaled down for the Pyeongchang Games.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/21/sports/olympics/mikaela-shiffrin-skis.html', 'snippet': 'She usually takes 70 pairs to competitions, ready for every kind of race, weather and snow, but she scaled down for the Pyeongchang Games.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PYEONGCHANG, South Korea — Mikaela Shiffrin uses only one pair of skis for an Olympic race. But just in case, she has 35 pairs with her here at the Winter Games — and, for her, that’s a relatively light load.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/21seventyskis-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 396, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/21seventyskis-web1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 396}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/21seventyskis-web1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 677, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/21seventyskis-web1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1353, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/22shiffrinskis1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/22shiffrinskis1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/22/sports/22shiffrinskis1/22shiffrinskis1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Mikaela Shiffrin Brought 35 Pairs of Skis to the Olympics', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'It Never Hurts to Have a Backup, or 34', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2018)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALPINE SKIING', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shiffrin, Mikaela', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vonn, Lindsey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-21T10:01:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/47279d04-6f83-5117-bca4-65a7b8028c27', 'word_count': 959, 'uri': 'nyt://article/47279d04-6f83-5117-bca4-65a7b8028c27'}, {'abstract': 'Hotels, shops, bars, restaurants — dogs are welcomed warmly just about everywhere. For Pip (a.k.a. Pierre), the prancing was never better.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/21/travel/dogs-travel-france.html', 'snippet': 'Hotels, shops, bars, restaurants — dogs are welcomed warmly just about everywhere. For Pip (a.k.a. Pierre), the prancing was never better.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The idea of bringing Pip along on our vacation to France was so we would blend in. Of course we were thinking of him, too. Pip is our dog, a runaway rat terrier we adopted from a shelter. He has leftover anxiety from his past life and we worried that he would be stressed out in a kennel. But we admit that we had a selfish reason. We wanted to experience France more as temporary residents than obvious tourists.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/travel/25pip-personal4/merlin_133916859_c7aae236-9f17-4bcc-938e-887fc77fe8d7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 467, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/travel/25pip-personal4/merlin_133916859_c7aae236-9f17-4bcc-938e-887fc77fe8d7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 467}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/travel/25pip-personal4/merlin_133916859_c7aae236-9f17-4bcc-938e-887fc77fe8d7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 796, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/travel/25pip-personal4/merlin_133916859_c7aae236-9f17-4bcc-938e-887fc77fe8d7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1593, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/travel/25pip-personal4/25pip-personal4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/25/travel/25pip-personal4/25pip-personal4-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image',