f_material': 'Letter', '_id': 'nyt://article/94391bc4-566f-5b27-b1b4-91ac7e62648d', 'word_count': 187, 'uri': 'nyt://article/94391bc4-566f-5b27-b1b4-91ac7e62648d'}, {'abstract': 'The Facebook co-founder’s rise was meteoric. He argues that the same forces that helped him succeed have made it harder for others. In a new book, “Fair Shot,” he proposes a bold solution.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/21/books/review/chris-hughes-facebook-fair-shot.html', 'snippet': 'The Facebook co-founder’s rise was meteoric. He argues that the same forces that helped him succeed have made it harder for others. In a new book, “Fair Shot,” he proposes a bold solution.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chris Hughes was raised by Lutheran parents in Hickory, N.C., and they taught him, by example, to tithe. Every year, they gave 10 percent of their income to the church and other local charities, and Mr. Hughes carried that tradition into adulthood. But in 2008, when he sold $1 million of his Facebook shares on private markets, and the amount of money he needed to give away increased exponentially, he started thinking more seriously about where his contributions might make the most impact.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/merlin_133718583_9b13f381-0890-4ed3-bca8-950f92ef8676-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/merlin_133718583_9b13f381-0890-4ed3-bca8-950f92ef8676-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/merlin_133718583_9b13f381-0890-4ed3-bca8-950f92ef8676-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/merlin_133718583_9b13f381-0890-4ed3-bca8-950f92ef8676-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/00CHRISHUGHES-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/00CHRISHUGHES-02-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/20/arts/00CHRISHUGHES-02/00CHRISHUGHES-02-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Redemption of Chris Hughes', 'kicker': 'Profile', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Inequality: A Secret  To His Success', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Income Inequality', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Philanthropy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Facebook Inc', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Hughes, Chris (1983- )', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Fair Shot: Rethinking Inequality and How We Earn (Book)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Economic Security Project', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-21T20:01:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Concepción de León', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Concepción', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'de León', 'qualifier': None, 'title': Non