tml', 'snippet': 'The United States had never beaten Canada in Olympic competition. Now it has done it twice in four days.', 'lead_paragraph': 'GANGNEUNG, South Korea — Four years after he was basically cut from the United States curling program, John Shuster began to celebrate with his teammates before his final rock of the match even came to a rest. The victory was as improbable as it was meaningful.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/sports/23uscurling1/merlin_134401586_0944fb7b-6c34-4106-be0f-1d64f5f0d88d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/23/sports/23uscurling1/merlin_134401586_0944fb7b-6c34-4106-be0f-1d64f5f0d88d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/sports/23uscurling1/merlin_134401586_0944fb7b-6c34-4106-be0f-1d64f5f0d88d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/sports/23uscurling1/merlin_134401586_0944fb7b-6c34-4106-be0f-1d64f5f0d88d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/sports/23uscurling1/23uscurling1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/23/sports/23uscurling1/23uscurling1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None