lator in the state to resign over sexual allegations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/22/us/tony-mendoza-sexual-harassment.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Mendoza, a Democratic state senator from the Los Angeles area, was facing an expulsion vote. He is the third legislator in the state to resign over sexual allegations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — The #MeToo movement continued to convulse California’s halls of power on Thursday as Tony Mendoza, a powerful Democratic state senator, resigned from the Legislature after an investigation into allegations that he had made improper advances toward several women.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/us/23mendoza/merlin_133992447_b919ba11-fedd-469f-b3dd-6eae791fd714-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 475, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/23/us/23mendoza/merlin_133992447_b919ba11-fedd-469f-b3dd-6eae791fd714-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 475}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/us/23mendoza/merlin_133992447_b919ba11-fedd-469f-b3dd-6eae791fd714-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 811, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/us/23mendoza/merlin_133992447_b919ba11-fedd-469f-b3dd-6eae791fd714-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1623, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/us/23mendoza/23mendoza-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/23/us/23mendoza/23mendoza-thumbStanda