18/02/22/nyregion/subway-cosmetic-upgrades.html', 'snippet': 'Stations will receive $250 million for lights, USB ports and countdown clocks. The mayor had called the spending unnecessary at a time of crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What had seemed like a rare win for Mayor Bill de Blasio — sidelining Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo’s plan to add amenities like new lighting and USB ports at nearly three dozen New York City subway stations — turned into another defeat on Thursday when the subway’s governing board approved Mr. Cuomo’s plan.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/23/nyregion/23mtab/23mta-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150,