her president. Neither boast is true.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/23/us/politics/trump-says-no-president-has-ever-cut-so-many-regulations-not-quite.html', 'snippet': 'Mr. Trump claims to have cut 22 federal regulations for every one that is newly created — more, he says, than any other president. Neither boast is true.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — President Trump boasted again on Friday that he has unleashed a roaring American economy by cutting more red tape in the federal bureaucracy than any previous president, the latest attempt to prove he is making good on his campaign pledge to slash industry regulations.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/24/us/politics/24dc-regfacts/merlin_134470052_2fe03dda-0d00-4980-9009-c0f688e7c2da-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/24/us/politics/24dc-regfacts/merlin_134470052_2fe03dda-0d00-4980-9009-c0f688e7c2da-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/24/us/politics/24dc-regfacts/merlin_134470052_2fe03dda-0d00-4980-9009-c0f688e7c2da-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/24/us/politics/24dc-regfacts/merlin_134470052_2fe03dda-0d00-4980-9009-c0f688e7c2da-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/24/us/politics/24dc-regfacts/24dc-regfacts-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'su