ork City Crusade.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 424, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 424}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 724, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1449, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25brody/25brody-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Donald Trump, Evangelicals Have Found Their President', 'kicker': 'Opinion', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'In Trump Evangelicals Trust', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Evangelical Movement', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Freedom of Religion', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graham, Billy', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Graham, Franklin', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trump, Donald J', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-24T19:30:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By David Brody', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brody', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/8205be64-c0a9-5097-aa14-82d95e97daae', 'word_count': 1045, 'uri': 'nyt://article/8205be64-c0a9-5097-aa14-82d95e97daae'}, {'abstract': 'The curiosity that Steven Pinker’s vision of enlightenment leaves out.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/24/opinion/sunday/steven-pinker-reason.html', 'snippet': 'The curiosity that Steven Pinker’s vision of enlightenment leaves out.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When I was a child I lived in several worlds. First was the world that I understood to be the normal one: a world where people had professional degrees and followed their doctor’s instructions strictly and carefully; a world ruled by a solid-seeming secular and liberal consensus about what was scientific, what was certain, what was true.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/sunday-review/25Douthat/25Douthat-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/sunday-review/25Douthat/25Douthat-articleLarge.j