 'nyt://article/cd650f23-16fc-5aef-8f5d-2116a01de87d'}, {'abstract': 'A grim reptilian fable about a leader who’s not able.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/24/opinion/sunday/donald-trump-snake-dowd.html', 'snippet': 'A grim reptilian fable about a leader who’s not able.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On her way to work one morning, down the path along the lake, a tenderhearted woman saw a rich, coldhearted, frozen snake.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25Dowd/25Dowd-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge'