 and Shiffrin accounted for all three American medals in Alpine skiing. And Vonn is headed toward the exit.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/24/sports/olympics/american-skiiing-alpine-shiffrin-vonn.html', 'snippet': 'At the Pyeongchang Olympics, Lindsey Vonn and Shiffrin accounted for all three American medals in Alpine skiing. And Vonn is headed toward the exit.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PYEONGCHANG, South Korea — Eight years ago at the Vancouver Winter Olympics, four racers on the United States ski team combined to win eight medals in the 10 Alpine events, including two golds. The American medal haul, led by Bode Miller, was twice the amount of any other nation.', 'print_section': 'SP', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/merlin_134384114_aac21d9a-bc42-4217-af5c-ce0f96506bf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/merlin_134384114_aac21d9a-bc42-4217-af5c-ce0f96506bf3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/merlin_134384114_aac21d9a-bc42-4217-af5c-ce0f96506bf3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/merlin_134384114_aac21d9a-bc42-4217-af5c-ce0f96506bf3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/25skiteam1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/25skiteam1-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/sports/25skiteam1/25skiteam1-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'For the Moment, Mikaela Shiffrin Is Looking a Little Lonely at the Top', 'kicker': 'On Skiing', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Right Now, Shiffrin Is Alone at the Top', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ALPINE SKIING', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Olympic Games (2018)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Shiffrin, Mikaela', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Vonn, Lindsey', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Pyeongchang (South Korea)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-24T20:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Sports', 'section_name': 'Sports', 'subsection_name': 'Olympics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bill Pennington', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bill', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Pennington', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/14ce2a68-d03a-536a-8790-10c0ced77023', 'word_count': 873, 'uri': 'nyt://article/14ce2a68-d03a-536a-8790-10c0ced77023'}, {'abstract': 'Qualified applicants only.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/24/opinion/sunday/wanted-a-personal-assistant-for-some-unconventional-tasks.html', 'snippet': 'Qualified applicants only.', 'lead_paragraph': 'I’m a very busy woman looking for a personal assistant to help me with certain important tasks. This is not your average assistant job — you will not be getting me coffee. Actually, I would be happy to supply you with a morning latte, as errands give me a sense of purpose and a feeling of accomplishment I rarely derive from other activities in my daily life. In fact, what I’m looking for is an assistant to take care of some of my more personal business so that I may focus on my true passion: grocery shopping.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/merlin_134496002_5473021a-54b2-49eb-b4b9-8ed79af8f1da-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/merlin_134496002_5473021a-54b2-49eb-b4b9-8ed79af8f1da-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/merlin_134496002_5473021a-54b2-49eb-b4b9-8ed79af8f1da-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/merlin_134496002_5473021a-54b2-49eb-b4b9-8ed79af8f1da-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/25cella-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/25cella-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opinion/sunday/25cella/25cella-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Wanted: A Personal Assistant for Some Unconventional Tasks', 'kicker': 'Loose Ends', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Wanted: A Personal Assistant', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Comedy and Humor', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-24T20:14:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'subsection_name': 'Sunday Review', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mary Cella', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mary', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Cella', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/7af8a97c-c47e-5975-a23b-ae46e36bb0cd', 'word_count': 605, 'uri': 'nyt://article/7af8a97c-c47e-5975-a23b-ae46e36bb0cd'}, {'abstract': 'The presence of a firearm is always an invitation to violence.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/24/opinion/sunday/marine-gun-classroom.html', 'snippet': 'The presence of a firearm is always an invitation to violence.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Before the United States Marine Corps allowed me to carry a live M-16 assault rifle, I went through hundreds of hours of firearms training. Classroom sessions devoted to nomenclature, maintenance and basic operation accounted for more than two weeks of study before I even set eyes on ammunition. For weeks, I carried an M-16 without a magazine — a dummy weapon, basically. I secured it with a padlock overnight while I slept in the barracks, and unlocked it each morning before chow.', 'print_section': 'SR', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/25/opini