y slight increases and even some declines when it comes to the diversity of certain areas. “You’d think there would be better results,” said an author of an annual report.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/27/business/media/hollywood-diversity.html', 'snippet': 'Hollywood has seen very slight increases and even some declines when it comes to the diversity of certain areas. “You’d think there would be better results,” said an author of an annual report.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LOS ANGELES — For the past five years, researchers at the University of California, Los Angeles, have hammered Hollywood with annual reports on its exclusion of women and minorities. Academics at the University of Southern California and San Diego State University have done the same. The public has weighed in with #OscarsSoWhite.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/28/business/28FILMDIVERSITY1/merlin_133340681_1845637a-3572-4da5-9868-26f34307146d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/02/28/business/28FILMDIVERSITY1/merlin_133340681_1845637a-3572-4da5-9868-26f34307146d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/28/business/28FILMDIVERSITY1/merlin_133340681_1845637a-3572-4da5-9868-26f34307146d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/02/28/business/28FILMDIVERSITY1/merlin_133340681_1845637a-3572-4da5-9868-26f34307146d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': No