 the United States now, and many are more comfortable with a female tattoo artist.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Chic décor and a comfy lounge are more suggestive of a day spa than a tattoo parlor, but a new shop in Brooklyn aims to change that perception. At Nice Tattoo Parlor in the Carroll Gardens section of Brooklyn, the concept — a tattoo shop with a friendly staff of female artists in a welcoming, judgment-free space — is both simple and a striking departure in the tattoo world. While Nice Tattoo welcomes all genders, women make up the majority of its clients.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/01/fashion/01TATTOOS1/merlin_134239436_6be822cb-4ff0-4426-a56d-73f61dc8919e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/01/fashion/01TATTOOS1/merlin_134239436_6be822cb-4ff0-4426-a56d-73f61dc8919e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/01/fashion/01TATTOOS1/merlin_134239436_6be822cb-4ff0-4426-a56d-73f61dc8919e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/01/fashion/01TATTOOS1/merlin_134239436_6be822cb-4ff0-4426-a56d-73f61dc8919e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/01/fashion/01TATTOOS1/01TATTOOS1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/01/fashion/01TATTOOS1/01TAT