ts, stylish hotels and maybe a game of checkers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/28/travel/ipoh-malaysia-tourism.html', 'snippet': 'The city’s comeback started with a water park. Now, visitors come for the roster of appealing restaurants, stylish hotels and maybe a game of checkers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In the middle of the 1900s, the northwestern Malaysian town of Ipoh was the world’s largest producer of tin and its booming success showed.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/merlin_133331988_d753ff7f-56de-4238-86cb-ee187b8b8a39-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/merlin_133331988_d753ff7f-56de-4238-86cb-ee187b8b8a39-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/merlin_133331988_d753ff7f-56de-4238-86cb-ee187b8b8a39-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/merlin_133331988_d753ff7f-56de-4238-86cb-ee187b8b8a39-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/04ipoh4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/04ipoh4-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04ipoh4/04ipoh4-thumbLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Why Ipoh, Malaysia, Should Be on Your Travel Radar', 'kicker': 'Explorer', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Cafes Help a City Reinvent Itself', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Malaysia', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ipoh (Malaysia)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-28T10:01:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Travel', 'section_name': 'Travel', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sanjay Surana', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sanjay', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Surana', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/4e0eb64e-6913-53a5-918f-79d094f5a682', 'word_count': 1351, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4e0eb64e-6913-53a5-918f-79d094f5a682'}, {'abstract': 'The Michelin-starred chef on his time in Puerto Rico after the hurricane and his legal issues with the Trump family.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/28/magazine/jose-andres-fights-starvation-with-mayo.html', 'snippet': 'The Michelin-starred chef on his time in Puerto Rico after the hurricane and his legal issues with the Trump family.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You spent months in Puerto Rico after Hurricane Maria hit in October, distributing millions of cooked meals. Your charity, World Central Kitchen, generally stays in disaster zones for only a short period of time. What was it about Puerto Rico that moved you to stay for so long? Many people on the island rely on electric kitchens — even if you gave them dry beans and rice, they wouldn’t be able to cook it. On top of that, many of them barely had water for drinking — imagine for cooking. We thought we were going to provide relief for a few days until everything came back to normal. But then I realized that the problem was much bigger than that and that the need was only going to become bigger, not smaller.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '54', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-talk-promo/04mag-talk-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'José Andrés Fights Starvation With Mayo', 'kicker': 'Talk', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'José Andrés Fights Starvation With Mayo', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cooking and Cookbooks', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Humanitarian Aid', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Hurricane Maria (2017)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'World Central Kitchen', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Andres, Jose (1969- )', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-28T10:01:08+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'Interview by Dan Amira', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Interview', 'middlename': 'Dan', 'lastname': 'Amira', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/cc21b05d-3f09-53f2-bfdf-df014b417435', 'word_count': 691, 'uri': 'nyt://article/cc21b05d-3f09-53f2-bfdf-df014b417435'}, {'abstract': 'It started when a paint can fell on the patient’s foot. But it got worse and worse from there.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/28/magazine/a-painful-bruise-wouldnt-heal-it-took-several-hospital-visits-to-discover-why.html', 'snippet': 'It started when a paint can fell on the patient’s foot. But it got worse and worse from there.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The woman lay on the floor, too weak even to lift the phone to her ear. She could hear her sister calling her name through the phone’s tinny speaker, but she couldn’t reply. A rush of relief flooded over her when she heard her sister say to someone, “Call 911.” And then there was darkness.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '16', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-articleLarge.png', 'height': 544, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 544}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-jumbo.png', 'height': 929, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1500, 'width': 1654, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/magazine/04mag-diagnosis1/04mag-04diagnosis-t_CA1-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A Painful Bruise Wouldn’t Heal. It Took Several Hospital Visits to Discover Why.', 'kicker': 'Diagnosis', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Vitamin C', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Medicine and Health', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-28T10:01:10+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Magazine', 'section_name': 'Magazine', 'byline': {'original': 'By Lisa Sanders, M.D', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Lisa', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sanders', 'qualifier': 'M.D', 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b5a5b18c-55a0-56cf-bcbb-02190715f062', 'word_count': 1360, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b5a5b18c-55a0-56cf-bcbb-02190715f062'}, {'abstract': 'An unparalleled economic powerhouse and megacity of 24 million people, the Chinese city was a frugal challenge. But it can be done (plenty of delicious dumplings helped). ', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2018/02/28/travel/shanghai-china-budget-affordable-dumplings-art.html', 'snippet': 'An unparalleled economic powerhouse and megacity of 24 million people, the Chinese city was a frugal challenge. But it can be done (plenty of delicious dumplings helped). ', 'lead_paragraph': 'Superlatives are everywhere in Shanghai. I forked over my 50 yuan (about $7.90) and boarded the maglev train departing from Pudong International Airport. My understanding was that this was a high-speed train, like the one I’d recently taken from Chengdu to Xian. I didn’t realize that, operating by a giant set of magnets that caused it to levitate over the track (hence the name, maglev), it was the fastest commercially operating train in the world. After leaving precisely on time, our speed began to build. And build. Soon, we were screaming through a blur of new housing developments and farmland at 268 miles per hour as we made our way from the Pacific coast to the heart of Shanghai. The ride, while not exactly smooth — you feel the speed — was exhilarating. I stepped off 19 miles and a few minutes later at Longyang Road, slightly dazed.', 'print_section': 'TR', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 381, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 381}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 651, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1302, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2018/03/04/travel/04frugal-shanghai-1/04frugal-shanghai-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Conquering High-Priced Shanghai, From Dumplings to Modern Art', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Dumplings Favor the Stingy', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Shanghai (China)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budget Travel', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2018-02-28T10:01:12+0000', 'document_type'